Driver { forever: rotate: 40deg/s; }
Title  { 0s..1s: opacity: 0 -> 1; }
Step1  { 0s..0.6s: opacity: 0 -> 1; 3.4s..4s: opacity: 1 -> 0; }
Step2  { 0s..4s: opacity: 0;  4s..4.6s: opacity: 0 -> 1; 7.4s..8s: opacity: 1 -> 0; }
Step3  { 0s..8s: opacity: 0;  8s..8.6s: opacity: 0 -> 1; }
Output { 8s..9s: color: #bf7a4b -> #ff9a5c; }
